                                     claims read without checking   checked properly
  a good token                       accepted as analyst-17         accepted as analyst-17
  expired an hour ago                accepted as analyst-17         refused: ExpiredSignatureError
  issued for another API             accepted as analyst-17         refused: InvalidAudienceError
  from another issuer                accepted as analyst-17         refused: InvalidIssuerError
  signed with someone else's key     accepted as analyst-17         refused: InvalidSignatureError
  no signature at all (alg none)     accepted as analyst-17         refused: InvalidAlgorithmError
